{"ts":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z","author":"codex-root","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"The full audit found src/index.ts and src/storage/index.ts concentrating parsing, routing, IO, formatting, and lifecycle behavior. Plan incremental extractions rather than a rewrite: define stable seams, move one coherent command family at a time, add contract tests before movement, and ratchet per-file coverage as ownership becomes clearer."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"searx-modular-command-architecture"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Decompose command and storage monoliths behind tested module boundaries"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Reduce change risk in the 2,660-line command dispatcher and 1,368-line storage module through incremental extraction and contract tests."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Feature"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["architecture","coverage","maintainability","testing"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2027-01-16T17:12:24.079Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/assignee","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"codex-root"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":720},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Command families have explicit module ownership; storage concerns are split by responsibility; public CLI and SDK behavior remains compatible; per-file coverage improves without disabling global gates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/definition_of_ready","value":"A dependency map and prioritized extraction sequence are reviewed."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"searx-security-modernization"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":70},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/sprint","value":"backlog"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/release","value":"future"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"searx-repository-audit","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Source inventory: src/index.ts is 2,660 lines and src/storage/index.ts is 1,368 lines."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Avoid a flag-day rewrite; each extraction must preserve CLI snapshots, exit codes, and configuration compatibility."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-16T17:12:24.079Z","author":"codex-root","text":"The lowest-covered and most frequently edited orchestration modules are the best initial extraction candidates."}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/files","value":[{"path":"src/index.ts","scope":"project","note":"Command orchestration monolith"},{"path":"src/storage/index.ts","scope":"project","note":"Persistence monolith"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"bun run test:unit","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":180}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/docs","value":[{"path":"CONTRIBUTING.md","scope":"project","note":"Future architecture guidance"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"72498451d987fda218aa629a0f551babecbe0c44c7c6795a3b39d2be889f1e01","message":"Capture maintainability roadmap discovered during audit"}
